RANDOM ENCOUNTERS

These random encounter tables for settled planets
cover a wide cross-section of society and can be used
by referees in emergencies or when the Travellers do
something unexpected. Encounters should be adjusted
based on the culture and technology of the planet. The
referee should roll for a new encounter every six hours
on average (more often if the Travellers are moving
great distances or attracting attention).

